 "schema": "pcc.claim/v1",
 "scope": "fixed native leased-affine component and conditional-row controls; unsigned producer evidence",
 "statement": "Versioned bounded leased-affine component preserves exact old-v1 disabled answers, decisions and counters on 33 fixed systems. On 28 fixed curve inputs both baseline and enabled arms return 15 roots; enabled has zero caps and no completed-curve node gains, retaining the baseline outcome classes. Separate coefficient/lifetime/unit-application controls and original/group replay are retained. Component/checker primitive accounting is charged, but full cold and allocation costs remain open; no speed, asymptotic, huge-base or signed-validation claim."
